1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,900
This block is one billion dollars.

2
00:00:03,050 --> 00:00:07,200
In $100 bills, that means
10 million notes.

3
00:00:08,050 --> 00:00:11,450
10,000 notes make
one million dollars.

4
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:16,300
A billion needs 1,000
stacks like this.

5
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:21,300
Together, they weigh
about 10 metric tons.

6
00:00:23,200 --> 00:00:30,400
The column climbs roughly 1.1 kilometers—
higher than the Burj Khalifa.

7
00:00:31,400 --> 00:00:34,600
10 million pieces of paper.
One billion dollars.
